md  \nreasoning: The deployments for frontend, geo, profile, rate, recommendation, reservation, search, and user are not in a ready state (READY: 0/1). To diagnose the root cause, I need to inspect the underlying pods for these deployments. The command "kubectl get pods -n hotel-reservation" will reveal if pods are crashing, pending, or in a failed state. This will help identify specific issues like image pull errors, configuration mismatches, or resource constraints.  \n\ntool_call: {"command": "kubectl get pods -n hotel-reservation"}', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 473, 'prompt_tokens': 3249, 'total_tokens': 3722, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfac0-c40f-77f2-8dbe-dd28f2fa27f1-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3249, 'output_tokens': 473, 'total_tokens': 3722}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='67fe2c58-8b8e-4267-bf81-868004ee4ad7'), AIMessage(content='<think>\nOkay, let\'s see. The user is trying to diagnose a hotel reservation application with multiple microservices. So far, they\'ve checked the services and deployments using kubectl commands. The deployments for several services like frontend, geo, profile, etc., are not ready. Now, they need to check the pods to see why those deployments aren\'t working.\n\nThe next logical step is to get the list of pods in the hotel-reservation namespace. The command "kubectl get pods -n hotel-reservation" will show the current state of all pods. If some pods are in a CrashLoopBackOff state, or if there are errors like image pull failures, that would indicate the problem. Also, checking the number of pods and their statuses can reveal if there are any issues with the deployment configuration or resource limits.\n\nBy running this command, the user can gather detailed information about each pod\'s status. If any pods are not running, they can then use further commands like "kubectl describe pod" or "kubectl logs" to get more insights into why they\'re failing. This will help pinpoint the root cause, such as a misconfigured environment variable, a missing dependency, or a problem with the container image.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl get pods -n hotel-reservation"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-93c687526e017cdd', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 277, 'prompt_tokens': 4280, 'total_tokens': 4557, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfac0-da92-7e82-b294-1ecdd6b24ff4-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl get pods -n hotel-reservation'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-93c687526e017cdd', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4280, 'output_tokens': 277, 'total_tokens': 4557}), ToolMessage(content='NAME                                      READY   STATUS              RESTARTS   AGE\nconsul-5c696cc4dc-ptjzq                   1/1     Running             0          3m28s\nfrontend-78986558db-2txmx                 0/1     RunContainerError   0          51s\ngeo-7bf795c745-q2hcn                      0/1     RunContainerError   0          50s\njaeger-5b9775bd94-s4vvz                   1/1     Running             0          3m24s\nmemcached-profile-6849578b8-7h4c2         1/1     Running             0          3m21s\nmemcached-rate-948594dfd-v4lp5            1/1     Running             0          3m16s\nmemcached-reserve-68dbb57476-nw9d7        1/1     Running             0          3m4s\nmongodb-geo-8cb7d9f5b-cfgt7               1/1     Running             0          3m25s\nmongodb-profile-775dfd4bd7-kw7kv          1/1     Running             0          3m19s\nmongodb-rate-bfbcf4587-4h567              1/1     Running             0          3m15s\nmongodb-recommendation-674dddbcdf-vz5kx   1/1     Running             0          3m10s\nmongodb-reservation-6cdf69dcc-g2jdx       1/1     Running             0          3m1s\nmongodb-user-6dcf4877-fh26q               1/1     Running             0          2m52s\nprofile-564d59fc59-zp4h6                  0/1     RunContainerError   0          50s\nrate-55d678488c-psf7k                     0/1     RunContainerError   0          48s\nrecommendation-dc9bc7d9c-dqx5l            0/1     RunContainerError   0          46s\nreservation-67695788bb-zzhp7              0/1     RunContainerError   0          43s\nsearch-6584c568c9-8qgr7                   0/1     RunContainerError   0          39s\nuser-76947c994b-h9skm                     0/1     RunContainerError   0          41s\nwrk2-job-cw462                            1/1     Running             0          53s\n', id='b74718a8-8df0-456a-baa9-705f1e6affb7', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-93c687526e017cdd'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='91c8ad80-3f7f-4eda-b033-68b94ad2bdf8')]]
