ontainer failed to start. The logs should provide more details, but the incorrect container name is preventing access. So, first, check the pod\'s description to find the correct container name, then retrieve the logs again with the right name.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl describe pod frontend-78986558db-2txmx -n hotel-reservation"}', 'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-80d5e809a5ad9f32', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 462, 'prompt_tokens': 5195, 'total_tokens': 5657, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfac1-113c-70c0-b34b-a133444f7b58-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl describe pod frontend-78986558db-2txmx -n hotel-reservation'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-80d5e809a5ad9f32', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 5195, 'output_tokens': 462, 'total_tokens': 5657}), ToolMessage(content='Name:             frontend-78986558db-2txmx\nNamespace:        hotel-reservation\nPriority:         0\nService Account:  default\nNode:             node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net/128.110.96.31\nStart Time:       Tue, 17 Mar 2026 07:43:41 +0000\nLabels:           io.kompose.service=frontend\n                  pod-template-hash=78986558db\nAnnotations:      kompose.cmd: kompose convert\n                  kompose.version: 1.22.0 (955b78124)\n                  sidecar.istio.io/statsInclusionPrefixes:\n                    cluster.outbound,cluster_manager,listener_manager,http_mixer_filter,tcp_mixer_filter,server,cluster.xds-grp,listener,connection_manager\n                  sidecar.istio.io/statsInclusionRegexps: http.*\nSt