ect, then the issue might be with the image itself, such as it not being built properly or not being pushed to the registry. But given the information, the immediate fix is to correct the image reference in the deployment.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl describe pod frontend-78986558db-2txmx -n hotel-reservation"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8b6c8c897b1a60bc', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 488, 'prompt_tokens': 4953, 'total_tokens': 5441, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfac2-679b-77a3-93d0-66051dceda23-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl describe pod frontend-78986558db-2txmx -n hotel-reservation'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8b6c8c897b1a60bc', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4953, 'output_tokens': 488, 'total_tokens': 5441}), ToolMessage(content='Name:             frontend-78986558db-2txmx\nNamespace:        hotel-reservation\nPriority:         0\nService Account:  default\nNode:             node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net/128.110.96.31\nStart Time:       Tue, 17 Mar 2026 07:43:41 +0000\nLabels:           io.kompose.service=frontend\n                  pod-template-hash=78986558db\nAnnotations:      kompose.cmd: kompose convert\n                  kompose.version: 1.22.0 (955b78124)\n                  sidecar.istio.io/statsInclusionPrefixes:\n                    cluster.outbound,cluster_manager,listener_manager,http_mixer_filter,tcp_mixer_filter,server,cluster.xds-grp,listener,connection_manager\n                  sidecar.istio.io/statsInclusionRegexps: http.*\nStatus:           Running\nIP: